      "message": "refactor: remove obsolete ID-related validation methods\n\nRemove validate_prose_ids, extract_prose_statements, and private helper\nmethods (valid_id_format?, valid_id_naming?, find_duplicate_ids) as they\nare no longer needed after migrating from tagged_text to spec_text format.\n\nThe spec_text format does not include 'id' or 'normative' fields, making\nthese validation methods obsolete.\n\nAddresses review feedback from @BKhristenko",
